PlanoHero Layout is an application for working with planograms and creating photo reports.

With PlanoHero Layout, users receive a list of tasks and planograms to complete. They can mark the completion of tasks and give feedback to managers of the planogramming department.

PlanoHero Layout features:
Viewing the layout and store plans in augmented reality;
Viewing sent for execution and completed planograms;
Viewing the complete set of planograms;
Communication between the store manager and the planogramming department;
Receive notifications about new layouts and tasks;
Execution of planograms and creation of photo reports.

Personal account of the client of self-service car washes WASHERCAR (Wash and GO).

PAYCar from WASHERCAR allows you to replenish your balance in cash in the terminal or by credit card through APPLE PAY. With two touches, transfer the advance payment to the car wash station by scanning the QR code.

Opportunities:
- client's personal account;
- multilevel discount system;
- notifications about promotions;
- history of replenishment;
- self-service car wash card and much more.

For use:
- open the PAYCar application;
- scan the QR code located at the washing station;
- register using your phone number;
- make an advance payment for the washing post.

